Playbooks deploy kubernetes cluster with control plane and two worker nodes.

---------------
1. Playbook krnl_tasks.yaml
   - installs kubernetes and its components
   - loads kernel module and configures parameters
   - enables kubelet


2. Playbook master_k8s.yaml
   - launch Kubernetes control plane
   - installs Calico
   - configures kubectl

3. Playbook main_k8s.yaml
   - joins worker nodes to cluster

------------
These playbooks should be executed at once with run_playbooks.yaml.
krnl_tasks runs on all hosts.
master_k8s.yaml runs only on kubernetes control plane server.
main_k8s.yaml runs on both worker servers.
